    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 24,
    "stem": "A 19-year-old young woman who emigrated\nfrom Taiwan 8 years ago presents with fever,\nmalaise, myalgias, and arthritis and “coldness”\nin her upper extremities. She has a weak radial\npulse bilaterally, and a magnetic resonance\nangiogram demonstrates nearly 75% stenosis\nof the main arteries originating from the aorta.\nShe likely has which of the following\nrheumatologic conditions?",
