    "explanation": "A mosaic pattern of bone caused by increases in both\nosteoblastic and osteoclastic activity is characteristic\nof Paget disease of bone (osteitis deformans). Serum\nalkaline phosphatase is markedly increased. Hearing\nloss is common (from narrowing of the auditory\nforamen and compression of the eighth cranial nerve),\nand an increase in hat size due to frontal bossing is\noften noted.",
