    "stem": "A 50-year-old woman with a 20-year history of\ntype 2 diabetes mellitus presents with\nproteinuria, hypoalbuminemia, edema, and\nhyperlipidemia. She has not monitored her\nserum glucose levels over the past several\nyears. What is the classic morphologic finding\nin this condition?",
