    "stem": "A 70-year-old man presents with severe bone\npain and frequent respiratory infections. Serum\nprotein electrophoresis demonstrates an M\nprotein spike in the gamma region.\nRadiographs of the skull, long bones, and spine\ndemonstrate multiple “punched-out” lesions,\nand bone marrow aspiration demonstrates\nlarge numbers of neoplastic plasma cells. Which\nof the following statements is true of this\ndisorder?",
