    "correctChoice": "B",
    "explanation": "Multiple sclerosis is an example of type IV\nhypersensitivity reaction. Other type III or immune\ncomplex mediated reaction aside from the choices are\nserum sickness, arthus reaction and reactive bacterial\narthritis.",
