    "stem": "A 58 year old male, non-smoker, is referred for\nevaluation of marked erythrocytosis and\nsplenomegaly. A CBC showed a marked\nelevation of the RBC, WBC and platelet count.\nBlood uric acid level was also elevated. Oxygen\nsaturation was normal at 98%. Which of the\nfollowing is characteristic of this disorder ?",
