    "stem": "A 62 year old male, known hypertensive,\npresented to the ER due to an acute onset of\nchest pain. He described the chest pain as\nhaving a \"tearing\" quality and radiating to the\nback. 12L ECG showed no findings of ischemia\nor infarction Which of the following statements\nis true regarding the most likely condition ?",
