    "stem": "A 49-year old hypertensive male is noted to be\nrefractory to most oral medications save for\nACE inhibitors. Upon examination, a bruit is\nheard on auscultation of his kidneys. Elevated\nplasma renin was also determined. If we are to\nbiopsy the kidneys of this patient we are most\nlikely to identify:",
