    "id": "superexam-pathology-0584",
    "subject": "pathology",
    "originalNumber": 584,
    "stem": "A 56-year old post-gastrectomy patient\nconsults due to pallor and easy fatigability. CBC\ndone showed anemia. Peripheral smear showed\nlarge, egg-shaped macro-ovalocytes and\nhypersegmented neutrophils. Patient presents\nwith?",
