    "stem": "A 40-year old consulted due to a slowly\nenlarging, soft, painless, pre-auricular mass.\nSurgical excision of the mass was done.\nMicroscopically, the mass was composed of\nsmall, dark epithelial cells intermingled with a\nloose, myxoid connective tissue stroma with\nislands and strands of myoepithelial cells.\nThese findings are suggestive of?",
